                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bainbridge to Mr. Hay</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-04-08"><hi rendition="#italic">April 8,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bainbridge reports the signing, on April 8, by Russia and China, of the
                    convention relating to Manchuria.)</p>
